# neglect_24h.vlog: 24h of pure neglect. The baby evolves to Child at
# hatch+3600s (the Evolving animation is on screen at that snap); from then
# on poop-driven sickness applies, and with nothing ever cleaned or
# medicated SickDamage kills it hours before the 12h Starve timer would.
# Along the way: calls, care mistakes, and whatever poops the RNG draws.
reset 1700000000000 seed=9
t 1700000301000 -
snap hatched
